  Per-case result rows derived from a credentialed source
    NOT licensed here. They inherit the terms of the source they were derived
    from, and neither licence above grants any additional permission over them.
    This is deliberate: CC BY 4.0 would grant commercial reuse and adaptation,
    which the data use agreement governing the source may not permit for
    derivatives, even where the derived row carries only outcome flags and no
    source content. The current instances are
    `experiments/mimic_cxr_text/results/` and
    `experiments/mimic_cxr_image/results/`.

NO DATASET IS REDISTRIBUTED HERE, AND NEITHER LICENCE EXTENDS TO ANY OF THEM.
MedQA-USMLE, MedMCQA, NIH ChestX-ray14, CheXpert, SUPPORT2 and MIMIC-CXR each
carry their own terms and must be obtained from their own providers. MIMIC-CXR
in particular requires PhysioNet credentialing; this repository contains no
MIMIC report text, images, caches or subject and study identifiers. See
README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md sections 10 to 12.
